{"3481370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Firewheels Shop Simulator", "steam_appid": 3481370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481370/extras/98f917871b4998180232c2467765217a.poster.avif?t=1786644685\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481370/extras/98f917871b4998180232c2467765217a.webm?t=1786644685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481370/extras/98f917871b4998180232c2467765217a.mp4?t=1786644685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Firewheels Shop Simulator</strong> lets you manage a diecast model store. Organize shelves, assist customers, and expand your shop in a detailed, realistic world. Join our Discord to connect with other players and share your diecast shop experiences!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481370/extras/122553298ef673ce2961543e04763e43.poster.avif?t=1786644685\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481370/extras/122553298ef673ce2961543e04763e43.webm?t=1786644685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481370/extras/122553298ef673ce2961543e04763e43.mp4?t=1786644685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Diecast Shop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create the ultimate diecast empire from the ground up. Design, manage, and grow your dream diecast shop in a bustling city where your creativity and strategy will lead to success.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manager</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrange diecast models on shelves, optimize store layout for aesthetics and efficiency, and create an inviting shopping experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481370/extras/4c88f4c842c6fbaf71e06e153557a0c3.poster.avif?t=1786644685\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481370/extras/4c88f4c842c6fbaf71e06e153557a0c3.webm?t=1786644685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481370/extras/4c88f4c842c6fbaf71e06e153557a0c3.mp4?t=1786644685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize and decorate every corner of your store to create a charming and personalized shopping environment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock New Licenses</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy licenses from top brands to stock a wide range of diecast models. Add variety to your shop and attract more customers with every new brand you bring in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481370/extras/8413e13241be97b501ea41e323161dd3.poster.avif?t=1786644685\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481370/extras/8413e13241be97b501ea41e323161dd3.webm?t=1786644685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481370/extras/8413e13241be97b501ea41e323161dd3.mp4?t=1786644685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find Rare Items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt for rare and chase cars to add to your collection. Attract diecast enthusiasts and collectors by offering exclusive items.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trade with Customers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage with customers to trade diecast models. Build relationships and create a loyal customer base through fair and exciting trades.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your store’s physical space, upgrade interiors, and continually adapt to meet customer demands.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Online Orders</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Process and deliver online orders with a scooter, ensuring timely and accurate delivery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diecast Trading System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cleaning Mechanic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPC Interactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random Events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advertisement System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Banking &amp; Credit Systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Security Cameras &amp; Shoplifters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warehouse &amp; Inventory Management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vibrant &amp; Interactive City</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into Diecast Shop Simulator and build your dream diecast store from the ground up!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481370/extras/98f917871b4998180232c2467765217a.poster.avif?t=1786644685\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481370/extras/98f917871b4998180232c2467765217a.webm?t=1786644685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481370/extras/98f917871b4998180232c2467765217a.mp4?t=1786644685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Firewheels Shop Simulator</strong> lets you manage a diecast model store. Organize shelves, assist customers, and expand your shop in a detailed, realistic world. Join our Discord to connect with other players and share your diecast shop experiences!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481370/extras/122553298ef673ce2961543e04763e43.poster.avif?t=1786644685\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481370/extras/122553298ef673ce2961543e04763e43.webm?t=1786644685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481370/extras/122553298ef673ce2961543e04763e43.mp4?t=1786644685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Diecast Shop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create the ultimate diecast empire from the ground up. Design, manage, and grow your dream diecast shop in a bustling city where your creativity and strategy will lead to success.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manager</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrange diecast models on shelves, optimize store layout for aesthetics and efficiency, and create an inviting shopping experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481370/extras/4c88f4c842c6fbaf71e06e153557a0c3.poster.avif?t=1786644685\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481370/extras/4c88f4c842c6fbaf71e06e153557a0c3.webm?t=1786644685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481370/extras/4c88f4c842c6fbaf71e06e153557a0c3.mp4?t=1786644685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize and decorate every corner of your store to create a charming and personalized shopping environment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock New Licenses</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy licenses from top brands to stock a wide range of diecast models. Add variety to your shop and attract more customers with every new brand you bring in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481370/extras/8413e13241be97b501ea41e323161dd3.poster.avif?t=1786644685\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481370/extras/8413e13241be97b501ea41e323161dd3.webm?t=1786644685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481370/extras/8413e13241be97b501ea41e323161dd3.mp4?t=1786644685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find Rare Items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt for rare and chase cars to add to your collection. Attract diecast enthusiasts and collectors by offering exclusive items.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trade with Customers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage with customers to trade diecast models. Build relationships and create a loyal customer base through fair and exciting trades.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your store’s physical space, upgrade interiors, and continually adapt to meet customer demands.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Online Orders</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Process and deliver online orders with a scooter, ensuring timely and accurate delivery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diecast Trading System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cleaning Mechanic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPC Interactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random Events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advertisement System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Banking &amp; Credit Systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Security Cameras &amp; Shoplifters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warehouse &amp; Inventory Management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vibrant &amp; Interactive City</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into Diecast Shop Simulator and build your dream diecast store from the ground up!</p>", "short_description": "Co-Op Firewheels Shop Simulator lets you manage a diecast model store. Organize shelves, assist customers, and expand your shop in a detailed, realistic world. Hunt for rare and chase cars, trade with customers, and grow your diecast empire.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Finnish, Greek, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Swedish, Turkish, Vietnamese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481370/3438956794178465cf779b4869e2b8faa021215b/header.jpg?t=1786644685", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481370/88e2de6ad4317282d20c0fd04fd43b5d5ec585da/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786644685", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481370/88e2de6ad4317282d20c0fd04fd43b5d5ec5